      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "## Platform Observability Overview\nThis dashboard shows the first real platform metrics now exposed by Prometheus: scrape health for the implemented services, backend request volume and latency, and the collector's inventory-flow metrics.\n\nCurrent limits:\n- `app-api` and `gnmi-collector` expose meaningful metrics today.\n- ODL, Grafana, and Postgres exporter metrics remain future placeholders and are intentionally excluded from active panels here.\n- Collector metrics are inventory-oriented Phase 1 scaffolds, not full telemetry coverage.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "title": "Dashboard Scope",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
